Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fade(500,500)\blur3}本字幕由悠哈璃羽字幕社製作，僅用於日語交流使用\N請勿私自二次上傳及用作商業用途
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fade(500,500)\blur3}翻譯:阿恁&雪音  校對:狗糧山  時軸:懶鬼後裔樰七  後期:冷麵珺  壓製:zoe  海報:狗糧山
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.13,0:00:20.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這個  請收下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.11,0:00:27.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是我聖誕節送給冬月小姐的毛毯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.81,0:00:32.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,一點都不冷哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.04,0:00:37.17,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和冰室先生在一起一直都很…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:41.85,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不可思議地  心裡會感到溫暖
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.84,0:00:44.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.39,0:00:48.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,為什麼冰室先生要謝我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.29,0:00:54.52,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是啊  為什麼呢  忍不住就脫口而出了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.36,0:00:58.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我才是  謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.40,0:01:02.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,竟然在公司也在用
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.02,0:01:10.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,果然  很暖和
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.30,0:01:17.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐  可以來一下嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.66,0:01:19.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,來了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.92,0:01:27.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,抱歉  是關於剛才資料的這部分…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.72,0:01:28.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.58,0:01:30.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐的生日快到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.25,0:01:37.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,謝謝惠顧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.75,0:01:44.17,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真的嗎  討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.64,0:01:48.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,送對方不喜歡的首飾  是最不討好的了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.43,0:01:49.71,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是啊是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.04,0:01:52.59,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,會讓人覺得明明還沒交往卻搞這麼正式
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.52,0:01:55.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這下就沒問題了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:05.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那時候買的首飾  還沒送出去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.75,0:02:07.82,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真沒出息
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.71,0:02:10.09,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喂  冰室
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.83,0:02:13.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這次不就是送出去的好機會嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.46,0:02:16.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,展現出你粉身碎骨渾不怕的雪球精神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.15,0:02:17.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,加油啊  冰室
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.74,0:02:20.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我碎了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.83,0:02:22.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雖然我倒不想粉身碎骨…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.36,0:02:24.16,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,也是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:27.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好  努把力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.80,0:02:40.80,Koori-title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,900)\blur5\pos(1415.333,751.333)}第10話
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.80,0:02:40.80,Koori-title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,900)\blur5\pos(1573.333,817.333)}暴風雨留宿大會！！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.82,0:02:46.41,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}冷たい指先感じられる距離感
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.82,0:02:46.41,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}能感受到指尖冰涼的距離感
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.90,0:02:52.49,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}もどかしくて少し切ない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.90,0:02:52.49,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}令人急不可待  又有些許愁緒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.19,0:02:58.50,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}ひとつずつ灯る街灯に呼応して
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.19,0:02:58.50,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}與一盞盞點亮的路燈遙相呼應
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.64,0:03:04.35,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}募っていく気持ちに気付いた
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.64,0:03:04.35,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}覺察到心中一點點積攢的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.47,0:03:12.00,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,照れ隠してもクールぶっても {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.47,0:03:12.00,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,不管是遮羞  抑或是裝酷 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.28,0:03:14.89,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,見透かされそう {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.28,0:03:14.89,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,都像會被看透似的 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.49,0:03:18.05,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,やさしく {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.49,0:03:18.05,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,溫柔地 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.05,0:03:20.30,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Freeze for a minute {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.05,0:03:20.30,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,凍結一分鐘 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.39,0:03:23.31,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,心ごと {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.39,0:03:23.31,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,全心全意 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.47,0:03:29.43,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,I miss you 言わせたくて {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.47,0:03:29.43,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,想讓你說  我想你 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.66,0:03:32.59,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Let me love you honey {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.66,0:03:32.59,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,讓我愛你  honey {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.78,0:03:35.62,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,言えない for real {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.78,0:03:35.62,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,說不出口  for real {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.87,0:03:43.61,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,いつか言葉にできたら {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.87,0:03:43.61,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,假如有朝一日能說出口 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.27,0:04:08.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,新年伊始就下傾盆大雨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.09,0:04:10.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好沒勁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.96,0:04:12.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,風也很大
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.51,0:04:15.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.36,0:04:17.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎麼了  火鳥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.82,0:04:20.91,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎麼你都濕透了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.14,0:04:23.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,因為出外勤了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.79,0:04:24.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和音無小姐一起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.07,0:04:28.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,遇上這種天氣  跑業務也太慘了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.35,0:04:31.83,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和音無小姐一起就完全沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.34,0:04:35.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真是倒大霉了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.76,0:04:37.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,音無小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.35,0:04:38.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.66,0:04:41.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.47,0:04:43.59,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,濕淋淋的  還冷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.77,0:04:45.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,電車還停運了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.35,0:04:48.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  這就停運了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.25,0:04:49.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這下麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:52.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,坐班車估計也很擠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.15,0:04:54.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.05,0:04:58.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,看來回家會很費勁啊  真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.96,0:05:01.91,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.95,0:05:06.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,乾脆一起去車站前的商務旅館住一晚？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.89,0:05:10.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這想法不錯呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.93,0:05:13.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,音無小姐也一起住嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.42,0:05:17.52,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,嘛  也不是不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.17,0:05:21.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好耶  大家一起留宿啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.05,0:05:25.87,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,對了  冬月小姐家的貓咪怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.25,0:05:27.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,餵食之類的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.93,0:05:29.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喵梅洛沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.62,0:05:36.37,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,有自動餵食器
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.93,0:05:40.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.49,0:05:42.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,能讓我也加入嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.93,0:05:47.24,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你這傢伙  不是剛搬到離公司步行五分鐘的地方嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.49,0:05:49.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不准亂入
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:54.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,話說回來  住得近真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.86,0:05:59.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,比起這個  今天讓我在你家待一晚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.00,0:06:01.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,電車停運我回不去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.38,0:06:03.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.01,0:06:06.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冴島先生你要怎麼辦  要來我家嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.59,0:06:09.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,誒  可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.45,0:06:10.80,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真是幫大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.63,0:06:14.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,當然可以  來我家打遊戲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.63,0:06:21.88,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,來吧  讓我們大戰一場
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.00,0:06:23.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你很有自信嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.44,0:06:26.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冴島先生也很會打嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.65,0:06:29.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我是不會輸給你的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.37,0:06:31.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好嘞  那就衝了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.92,0:06:32.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.22,0:06:37.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,生日  不知道冬月小姐有什麼打算
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.53,0:06:45.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好可怕啊  打雷好可怕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.36,0:06:49.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,狐森小姐  害怕打雷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.02,0:06:54.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,為什麼你們兩個不怕呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.51,0:06:58.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不就是聲音大點嗎  和煙花差不多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.20,0:07:03.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雖然我喜歡看煙花  但我真的受不了雷聲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.51,0:07:10.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喵梅洛小時候也很害怕打雷  但現在就不怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.26,0:07:12.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,狐森小姐一定也…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.33,0:07:15.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好可怕！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.70,0:07:18.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好可怕嗚嗚嗚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.69,0:07:23.10,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好像  小時候的喵梅洛…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.31,0:07:27.16,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,狐森小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.09,0:07:33.88,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,從今往後  如果你害怕打雷的話就聯繫我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.10,0:07:35.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不管何時何地
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.08,0:07:39.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我都會趕到你的身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.67,0:07:42.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.89,0:07:43.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你是她男朋友嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.12,0:07:49.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.65,0:07:51.85,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,狐森小姐不是有男朋友嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.36,0:07:56.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,狐森小姐原來有戀人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.41,0:07:59.37,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,明明都有我了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.67,0:08:04.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不是  這事我也是第一次聽說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.85,0:08:09.17,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你的男朋友難道不是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.70,0:08:12.77,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,同一個部門的…冴島先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.67,0:08:16.59,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,才不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:18.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那個傢伙才不是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.71,0:08:19.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.20,0:08:23.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,可是之前你們倆一起吃飯了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.37,0:08:30.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我出外勤時不小心看見了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.91,0:08:33.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那是怎麼回事呀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.53,0:08:40.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我  我們只是碰巧在休息時去了同一家想去的餐廳
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.67,0:08:42.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.40,0:08:44.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真的是偶然啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.04,0:08:47.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你很冷嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.69,0:08:50.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我把空調的溫度調高點？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.80,0:08:52.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,沒關係  我沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.69,0:08:55.95,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,話說  冰室你為什麼站著
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.03,0:08:56.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.03,0:08:58.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,火鳥先生  敵人來了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.32,0:09:04.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那  那音無小姐你又怎麼樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:09.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不是被表白了很多次嗎  被那個不死鳥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:13.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不死鳥…你說的是火鳥嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.41,0:09:15.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,難道還有其他人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.82,0:09:19.18,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,一天到晚老追在你屁股後面跑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.85,0:09:24.88,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他跟我不是這種關係啦  只是我關照的後輩而已
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.53,0:09:30.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你感冒了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.90,0:09:33.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,沒有  我不會感冒的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.89,0:09:35.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不愧是不死鳥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.96,0:09:37.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,話說  冰室你在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:43.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那個  有點  想給冬月小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.01,0:09:48.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真可疑  趕緊給我說出真相
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.79,0:09:50.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你指什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.40,0:09:53.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你們其實已經進展不錯了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.54,0:09:56.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這句話更適合你吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.51,0:09:58.87,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,抱歉  冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.90,0:10:00.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我們說嗨了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.71,0:10:04.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我不介意  你們看起來挺開心的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.67,0:10:07.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,沒有這回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.29,0:10:09.95,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,沒錯沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.59,0:10:12.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我其實…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.34,0:10:17.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,沒談過戀愛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.06,0:10:24.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,明明都是成年人了  很奇怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.44,0:10:28.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不不  才沒這回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.95,0:10:35.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那冰室先生  算怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.46,0:10:44.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生發來的消息
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.21,0:10:47.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你們平時也會聊天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.67,0:10:49.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,發來了什麼呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.11,0:10:52.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  沒什麼大事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.15,0:10:55.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好像是在和他們一起玩遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.26,0:11:01.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,嘴上說著「沒什麼大事」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.31,0:11:02.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,可表情…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.61,0:11:05.85,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,卻不像是沒事的樣子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:09.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,急死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.15,0:11:11.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今晚來喝個夠吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.25,0:11:14.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,音無小姐  我也喝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.01,0:11:16.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,給你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.69,0:11:22.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好了  來不來？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.55,0:11:29.66,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,乾杯——
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:33.17,Koori-p1,,0,0,0,,{\p1\fscx119\fscy160\pos(99.599,238.266)}m 0 0 l 0 -105 l 373 -104 l 373 0
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:33.17,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(138,96)}冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:33.17,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(138,170)}您有一條新消息
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:33.17,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(138,135.334)}-------------
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.92,0:11:40.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你在幹什麼啊  冰室
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.92,0:11:42.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是收到回復了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.05,0:11:44.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是冬月小姐吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.00,0:11:46.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,確實是她  但…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.27,0:11:49.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但你們想嘛  像這種情況
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.08,0:11:54.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要是我立馬就「已讀」了  不會顯得有些噁心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.61,0:11:58.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,聊天不用費這麼多心機的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.72,0:12:01.88,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,打工人的話  回復肯定是越快越好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.23,0:12:05.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喂  你們別擅自幫我已讀了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.73,0:12:08.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,什麼什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.64,0:12:11.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,大家在喝嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.83,0:12:15.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我們這邊女子三人組超嗨啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.52,0:12:16.59,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,很嗨的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.02,0:12:18.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,耶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.77,0:12:20.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這是天堂吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.05,0:12:23.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,感覺她們那邊很開心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.08,0:12:25.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:30.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好想變成女孩子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.62,0:12:35.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你  你在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.09,0:12:37.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我覺得…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.49,0:12:39.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,做男生就挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.88,0:12:46.94,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.26,0:12:50.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天終於到冬月小姐的生日了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.69,0:12:51.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你做好心理準備了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.45,0:12:54.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,粉身碎骨渾不怕呀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.41,0:12:57.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,都說了  我不想粉身碎骨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.01,0:13:00.94,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這是雪球精神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.37,0:13:08.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐的生日…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.08,0:13:12.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我絕對要把那個給她
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.44,0:13:20.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.83,0:13:30.83,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.95,0:13:32.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,為啥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.04,0:13:34.49,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我只是想叫住她而已
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.67,0:13:42.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不行  我…太緊張了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.53,0:13:45.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不行  不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.32,0:13:47.91,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不行——
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.92,0:13:52.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我做的這是什麼夢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.04,0:13:55.80,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,放鬆…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.46,0:13:58.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要放鬆  冰室
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.24,0:14:04.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐  今天是你的生日嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.72,0:14:05.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.12,0:14:09.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你怎麼不早點告訴我呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.98,0:14:13.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,把她給問住了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.12,0:14:18.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,其實我想多了解了解冬月小姐啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.07,0:14:20.46,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.60,0:14:26.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那今晚  我們一起去吃飯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.70,0:14:31.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不好意思  我今晚已經有約了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:37.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,誒  該不會是要約會吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.86,0:14:40.71,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不是不是  是和我父母見面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.18,0:14:42.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我要帶他們去吃飯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.32,0:14:44.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.37,0:14:47.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我覺得生日是要向父母傳達感謝之情的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.62,0:14:50.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,難得有機會和你吃頓飯  真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.42,0:14:52.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,原來是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.85,0:14:54.66,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐太了不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.32,0:15:00.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我得在冬月小姐下班之前把禮物給她才是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.06,0:15:04.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.63,0:15:05.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.84,0:15:07.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,過來一下可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:08.38,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.78,0:15:10.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哎呀  真是對不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.00,0:15:13.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,關於明天會議要用的資料
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.01,0:15:16.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,有份需要加急添上的…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.17,0:15:19.16,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的  您說的是哪份呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.55,0:15:28.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.04,0:15:29.10,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.56,0:15:32.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,聽起來像是假的  但這是真實發生的事哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.65,0:15:45.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那個  冬月…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.62,0:15:46.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.55,0:15:50.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,過來一下好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.66,0:15:51.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.91,0:16:01.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,您好  我是冰室
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.89,0:16:02.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,您辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.48,0:16:06.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的  稍後我把資料給您發過去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.65,0:16:08.49,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的  再見
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.70,0:16:14.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我怎麼也找不到機會和冬月小姐說上話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.38,0:16:15.17,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.78,0:16:17.24,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這個拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.88,0:16:18.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.68,0:16:29.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不過  我今天一天都看著她
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.58,0:16:34.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,發現冬月小姐  真是被職場上的大家所愛著啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.03,0:16:39.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,看到喜歡的人受歡迎  我自己都感覺很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.08,0:16:45.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不對  可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.63,0:16:52.41,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我不能在這裡敗下陣來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.44,0:16:57.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.96,0:16:59.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.77,0:17:03.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,太好了  我正好有事想問你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.31,0:17:08.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是關於明天會議上要用的資料
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.89,0:17:09.66,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.40,0:17:11.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這個部分…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.43,0:17:14.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  你說這裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.11,0:17:15.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這個是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.57,0:17:22.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,剛才謝謝你了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.35,0:17:23.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.09,0:17:26.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你給的意見很精準
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.05,0:17:30.18,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不愧是冰室先生呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.05,0:17:38.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.14,0:17:44.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.43,0:17:45.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.12,0:17:49.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天  可以一起回家嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.67,0:18:10.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,果然冷靜下來想想
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.18,0:18:14.09,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,還是不送這個禮物比較好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.60,0:18:17.17,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天很冷呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.14,0:18:27.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,在冬月小姐看來  我最多是個關係還不錯的男同事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.73,0:18:32.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這種關係  送首飾作為生日禮物會不會…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.08,0:18:37.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.99,0:18:40.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎樣能讓冬月小姐最感到開心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.55,0:18:45.29,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我完全搞不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.68,0:19:12.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.30,0:19:15.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,過於緊張  把附近一片都凍上了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.43,0:19:17.52,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.78,0:19:22.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你好厲害呀  冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.92,0:19:30.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天  其實是我的生日
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.97,0:19:37.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我能…把這個景色  當作生日禮物收下嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.83,0:19:40.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不  不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.91,0:19:43.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.81,0:19:46.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,請收下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.82,0:20:01.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我可以打開嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.01,0:20:24.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雪花形狀的耳墜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.63,0:20:28.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我第一眼看到  就覺得很適合冬月小姐你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.31,0:20:31.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,頭腦一熱就買下了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.48,0:20:33.73,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,想在今天送給你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.85,0:20:39.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐  祝你生日快樂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.22,0:20:44.24,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這是不會化的雪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.56,0:20:47.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,感覺就像冰室先生你一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.49,0:20:58.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.51,0:21:02.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我戴上好看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.35,0:21:16.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,非常  適合你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.34,0:21:32.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那個  冰室先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.03,0:21:33.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我在
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.53,0:21:39.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生的生日禮物  你想要什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.35,0:21:42.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那個  這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.25,0:21:46.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你來決定就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.98,0:21:49.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的  那就由我決定了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.45,0:22:13.98,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2A15D3&}ふと気づけばまた視線は　追い掛けてしまう君の姿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.45,0:22:13.98,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2A15D3&}突然發覺之時  視線又追逐上你的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.21,0:22:29.05,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2A15D3&}嫌なことがあっても心は　雨上がりの空のように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.21,0:22:29.05,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2A15D3&}即使遇上壞事  心也如雨後初晴的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.52,0:22:42.36,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2A15D3&}君の笑顔はどうしてこんなにも　ポカポカで温かいの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.52,0:22:42.36,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2A15D3&}你的笑容為何  如此和煦溫暖春風拂面
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.59,0:22:50.07,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,ねぇ、教えて　君のこと　何でもいいからさ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.59,0:22:50.07,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,告訴我可以嗎  只要是關於你什麼都行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.28,0:22:57.16,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,好きなこと　好きなもの　私にだけそっと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.28,0:22:57.16,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,只悄悄告訴我  你喜歡的事也好物也罷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.38,0:23:04.77,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,ねぇ、教えて　いつの日か　二人のこの距離を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.38,0:23:04.77,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,告訴我可以嗎  總會有一天我們的距離
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.15,0:23:15.48,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,少しずつ　少しずつ　なんて少しだけ期待してる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.15,0:23:15.48,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,我無比期待著  它能一點一點日漸縮短
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.64,0:23:29.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.69,0:23:34.59,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要不要  和我一起住呢？
